# redshift_comments (Data Source)

Lists the comments on a database and on its schemas, tables, views, columns, and table constraints, in the shape of
`redshift_comment`. See AWS [COMMENT](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/redshift/latest/dg/r_COMMENT.html).

